Grammar

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: BlockBody

    2 Expressions: Expressions COMMA Expression
    3            | Expression

    4 NonAttributedExpression: Block
    5                        | Call
    6                        | Function
    7                        | Type
    8                        | MatchExpression
    9                        | RuntimeExpression
   10                        | WrappedExpressions
   11                        | Literal

   12 WrappedExpressions: LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   13 Expression: Block
   14           | Call
   15           | Function
   16           | Type
   17           | MatchExpression
   18           | RuntimeExpression
   19           | WrappedExpressions
   20           | AttributedExpression
   21           | Literal

   22 Block: LBRACE BlockBody RBRACE

   23 BlockBody: Statements Expressions
   24          | Expressions

   25 MatchExpression: MATCH LPAREN Expression RPAREN LBRACE MatchCases RBRACE

   26 MatchCases: MatchCases MatchCase
   27           | MatchCase

   28 MatchCase: CASE Expression COLON Expressions SEMI

   29 Function: FUNCTION LPAREN FunctionParametersOptional RPAREN FunctionAttributes FunctionBody PERCENT

   30 FunctionParametersOptional: FunctionParameters
   31                           | ε

   32 FunctionParameters: FunctionParameters COMMA FunctionParameter
   33                   | FunctionParameter

   34 FunctionParameter: AccessAttribute IDENTIFIER TypeAttribute

   35 FunctionAttributes: FunctionAttributes FunctionAttribute
   36                   | FunctionAttribute

   37 FunctionAttribute: FunctionExternalAttribute
   38                  | FunctionInternalAttribute

   39 FunctionExternalAttribute: EXTERNAL LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   40 FunctionInternalAttribute: INTERNAL LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   41 FunctionBody: COLON Expressions
   42             | ε

   43 Call: NonAttributedExpression LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   44 RuntimeExpression: RUNTIME LPAREN Expression RPAREN

   45 Literal: STRING
   46        | INTEGER
   47        | FLOAT
   48        | CHAR
   49        | Identifier
   50        | MACRO
   51        | NIL

   52 Identifier: Identifier DOT IDENTIFIER
   53           | IDENTIFIER

   54 Type: TYPE LPAREN Expression RPAREN LBRACE TypeEntries RBRACE

   55 Statements: Statements Statement
   56           | Statement

   57 Statement: CallStatement
   58          | AssignmentStatement
   59          | ContinueStatement
   60          | BreakStatement
   61          | LabelStatement

   62 CallStatement: Call SEMI

   63 AssignmentStatement: AssignmentTarget EQ Expressions SEMI

   64 AssignmentTarget: AccessAttribute IDENTIFIER TypeAttribute
   65                 | Identifier
   66                 | UNDERSCORE

   67 ContinueStatement: CONTINUE IDENTIFIER Expressions SEMI

   68 BreakStatement: BREAK IDENTIFIER Expressions SEMI

   69 LabelStatement: IDENTIFIER COLON MatchExpression SEMI
   70               | IDENTIFIER COLON SEMI

   71 TypeAttributeOptional: TypeAttribute
   72                      | ε

   73 TypeAttribute: COLON Expression

   74 TypeEntries: TypeEntries TypeEntry
   75            | TypeEntry

   76 TypeEntry: IDENTIFIER TypeAttributeOptional SEMI

   77 AccessAttribute: IN
   78                | OUT
   79                | INOUT

   80 PointerAttribute: PTR
   81                 | REF

   82 AttributedExpression: AccessAttribute Expression
   83                     | PointerAttribute AttributedExpression


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    COMMA (258) 2 32
    LBRACE (259) 22 25 54
    RBRACE (260) 22 25 54
    LPAREN (261) 12 25 29 39 40 43 44 54
    RPAREN (262) 12 25 29 39 40 43 44 54
    SEMI (263) 28 62 63 67 68 69 70 76
    COLON (264) 28 41 69 70 73
    EQ (265) 63
